<!--
  teacher-login.html, student-account.html, and student-room.html are left out
  on purpose — they are account/session entry points, already marked
  noindex,nofollow in their own meta tags, and listed in robots.txt Disallow.
  teachers.html is left out for the same reason: it carries its own
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"> tag (it's a live classroom
  + student-analytics tool, not a marketing/content page), so listing it here
  would tell Search Console to index a URL the page itself says not to index
  — Google's own guidance is to fix that by leaving noindex'd URLs out of the
  sitemap entirely, not by also blocking them in robots.txt (a robots.txt
  block would stop Googlebot from ever seeing the noindex tag at all).
  The 22 skills/*.html pages linked from sat.html, act.html, and tsia2.html
  are now built with real, skill-specific explanations and worked examples
  and are listed below.

  The homepage is listed as https://scorepathpractice.com/ (not /index.html)
  to match index.html's own <link rel="canonical">. Static hosts serve
  index.html's content at the bare root by default, so this needs no server
  change to work; _redirects/vercel.json/.htaccess-redirect are included at
  the repo root as an optional belt-and-suspenders 301 from /index.html to /
  for hosts that support them, so the two URLs never compete as duplicates.
-->
